*  PROGRAM    :  W9703400                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PRODUCES A REPORT FROM DATA CREATED BY REXX W97034    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KJELL ANDRE                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     080409      KJELL ANDRÉ              9236                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
FILE W97034D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
SECID           1   8   A                                                       
DLM-SECID       *   2   A                                                       
FIRSTX          *  20   A                                                       
FIRSTNAME  FIRSTX  17   A                                                       
DLM-FIRST       *   2   A                                                       
LASTX           *  20   A                                                       
LASTNAME   LASTX   17   A                                                       
DLM-LAST        *   2   A                                                       
DEPT            *   7   A                                                       
DLM-DEPT        *   2   A                                                       
UID             *  24   A                                                       
DLM-UID         *   2   A                                                       
ACCESS          *   4   A                                                       
DLM-ACCESS      *   2   A                                                       
RESMASKX        *  30   A                                                       
RESMASK  RESMASKX  20   A                                                       
DLM-RESM        *   2   A                                                       
RULENAME        *   8   A                                                       
DLM-RULEN       *   2   A                                                       
RULELINE        *  24   A                                                       
DLM-RULEL       *   2   A                                                       
SRCHPATTERN     *  20   A                                                       
*                                                                               
FILE W97034D2  PRINTER VB (137 0)                                               
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W97034D1)                                                            
  PRINT A                                                                       
REPORT A  PRINTER W97034D2 LINESIZE 95 SPACE 1 NOADJUST +                       
          DTLCTL FIRST                                                          
SEQUENCE RESMASK ACCESS SECID RULENAME                                          
CONTROL  SRCHPATTERN NEWPAGE                                                    
TITLE 1  '          ACF2 access list for' SRCHPATTERN                           
HEADING SECID       ('User', 'Id')                                              
HEADING FIRSTNAME   ('First', 'name')                                           
HEADING LASTNAME    ('Last', 'name')                                            
HEADING DEPT        ('Dept.')                                                   
HEADING ACCESS      ('Acc', 'type')                                             
HEADING RULENAME    ('ACF2', 'rule')                                            
HEADING RULELINE    ('ACF2' 'line')                                             
LINE  1  +                                                                      
  SECID FIRSTNAME LASTNAME DEPT ACCESS +                                        
  RULENAME RULELINE                                                             
